  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusion, Integration, and Protection sustaining refugee access to education, protection, and livelihoods opportunities to foster resilience and social cohesion; and 

Preparedness for Return prioritising economic inclusion through skills development and formal employment, while expanding support for voluntary returns&#x2019; preparedness. This includes exploring provision of returns-related information alongside legal guidance, protection referrals, and humanitarian assistance, as well as targeted support at major border crossings for those choosing to return.</narrative>
